        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-371" edge="1" parent="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-378" source="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-369" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-370" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="390" y="545" />
              <mxPoint x="390" y="545" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-369" parent="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-378" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="先从用户相似度读取最相似的用户，如A-&amp;gt;[(C,0.952),(B,0.476)]，就选择C和B作为最相似的用户" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="330" x="20" y="530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-373" edge="1" parent="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-378" source="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-370" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="800" y="540" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-370" parent="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-378" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="从原始日志中拉取最相似用户的正反馈表，形如&lt;br&gt;C → [&lt;br&gt;    (c, 收藏, weight=4, 1天前),&lt;br&gt;    (b, 点赞, weight=2, 2天前),&lt;br&gt;    (e, 点击, weight=1, 3天前),&lt;br&gt;    (f, 收藏, weight=4, 4天前)&lt;br&gt;]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;B → [&lt;br&gt;    (b, 收藏, weight=4, 1天前),&lt;br&gt;    (a, 点赞, weight=2, 3天前),&lt;br&gt;    (d, 点击, weight=1, 2天前),&lt;br&gt;    (f, 点赞, weight=2, 5天前),&lt;br&gt;    (g, 收藏, weight=4, 6天前)&lt;br&gt;]&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;从C和B给予正反馈的items中挑选出A没有浏览过的作为候选items，这里就是f和g&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="210" x="460" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-375" edge="1" parent="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-378" source="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-372" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1290" y="540" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-372" parent="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-378" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;计算A和候选items之间的UserCF分数，公式为&lt;br/&gt;$$&lt;br&gt;\mathrm{score}(u, j) = \sum_{v \in N(u)} \mathrm{sim}(u, v) \cdot w_{v,j} \cdot 2^{-\frac{\Delta t_{v,j}}{7}}&lt;br&gt;$$&lt;br&gt;其中：&lt;br&gt;• \(N(u)\)：目标用户 \(u\) 的相似用户集合；&lt;br&gt;• \(\mathrm{sim}(u, v)\)：目标用户和相似用户的相似度；&lt;br&gt;• \(w_{v,j}\)：相似用户 \(v\) 对候选 Item \(j\) 的行为权重；&lt;br&gt;• \(\Delta t_{v,j}\)：相似用户对该 Item 的行为距离当前多少天；&lt;br&gt;• 半衰期设置为 7 天。&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="210" x="830" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-374" parent="BsnuHeq9HasgRQaaghQB-378" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol, Noto Color Emoji&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;选出分数最高的Top-K条&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="210" x="1310" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
